{"schemaVersion":"galpedia-static-detail-model-v1","dataRevision":"a0c0367b8270b080feef0ef1fe65522144dc62343feb9d752729d92867d0d639","workId":"32797","model":{"presentationWorkId":"vndb:v36650","staff":{"artwork":[{"creditedName":"小夏 はれ","creatorId":"vndb:s6006","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s6006","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s6006","name":"小夏 はれ","roleCode":"art","roleLabel":"原画","identityStatus":"source-native","relationId":"vndb:vn-staff:186019","source":"vndb"},{"creditedName":"Studio Fuji","creatorId":"vndb:s18775","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s18775","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s18775","name":"Studio Fuji","roleCode":"art","roleLabel":"原画","identityStatus":"source-native","relationId":"vndb:vn-staff:186021","source":"vndb"}],"scenario":[{"creditedName":"Munisix","creatorId":"vndb:s6005","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s6005","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s6005","name":"Munisix","roleCode":"scenario","roleLabel":"剧本","identityStatus":"source-native","relationId":"vndb:vn-staff:186016","source":"vndb"}],"music":[],"other":[{"creditedName":"Munisix","creatorId":"vndb:s6005","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s6005","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s6005","name":"Munisix","roleCode":"director","roleLabel":"导演","identityStatus":"source-native","relationId":"vndb:vn-staff:186017","source":"vndb"},{"creditedName":"Munisix","creatorId":"vndb:s6005","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s6005","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s6005","name":"Munisix","roleCode":"staff","roleLabel":"制作人员","identityStatus":"source-native","relationId":"vndb:vn-staff:186018","source":"vndb"},{"creditedName":"小夏 はれ","creatorId":"vndb:s6006","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s6006","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s6006","name":"小夏 はれ","roleCode":"staff","roleLabel":"制作人员","identityStatus":"source-native","relationId":"vndb:vn-staff:186020","source":"vndb"}]},"cast":[{"characterId":"char_vndb_c111120","characterName":"カージ＝オバーグ","sourceIds":{"vndbCharacterId":"c111120"},"originalCharacterName":"カージ＝オバーグ","characterNameSource":null,"role":"main","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"source-authoritative","metadata":{"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"m"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"An ordinary boy of entirely unremakarble talent. His hobby is deciphering old texts.Despite being the heir of Oberg Fruit Farm—designated supplier to the Grand Kitchen—Khaji's dream is to become a painter. Why? Simple. Because he loves looking at girls. And he wants “some sort of physical representation of their beauty.” Like portraits. Which he insists on painting himself.He runs up against a wall, however, when he discovers that effort alone will not suffice to compensate for his egregious lack of skill and sense. Hoping to get his mind off this disheartening realization, he heads to Perchwood, the private gathering spot of his group of rather eccentric friends."}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c111120"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/91/915ee2ebb1ec8860783746410bf3537255662bd1da85f7b1e9dc6eee5cc53fdb.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/c5/c51b4fb86d248d4aca22e277686e909fcc3e126a739084336ca885e52d4a142a.webp","width":218,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[]},{"characterId":"char_vndb_c123315","characterName":"アディア＝ヴィルマーク","sourceIds":{"vndbCharacterId":"c123315"},"originalCharacterName":"アディア＝ヴィルマーク","characterNameSource":null,"role":"primary","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"source-authoritative","metadata":{"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"f"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"Adia is currently training to be a fhariner, or boatman, for the fharin, one of Rughzenhaide's primary modes of transport. She always has a smile on her face and a skip in her step, has no trouble getting along with anyone, and almost never gets down about anything. Ritona is of the opinion that her personality is \"superhumanly good\"."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Adia lives in a dormitory run by the Serenhaides, but she has a surprising daring streak, and is known to sometimes sneak out at night. As a fhariner, her grades are as average as they get—she worries a little that her peers might all graduate ahead of her. She isn't exactly hiding it or anything, but she actually has a boyfriend."}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c123315"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/7c/7c6d89ab69b42bb338dfbe86a5aff908685912047fe2563920154ac6409e23d1.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/fd/fdf372162c5fa63f5a456aa87060fa180dd4a7e1427f0e8c278084374f7a2e36.webp","width":218,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[]},{"characterId":"char_vndb_c123319","characterName":"ソネッタ＝ヴァルツクライザ","sourceIds":{"vndbCharacterId":"c123319"},"originalCharacterName":"ソネッタ＝ヴァルツクライザ","characterNameSource":null,"role":"primary","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"source-authoritative","metadata":{"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"m"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"Sonetta is a trendy individual who plays the ruigat (pronounced roo-gah), a seven-stringed instrument and has an open and candid personality. Being a very accommodating and light hearted person, Sonetta does not have trouble getting along with anyone but has a habit of calling anyone he respects \"Miss\" or \"Mister\", even when they're the same age."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Despite his skill with the ruigat and excellent sense for music, Sonetta is overall weak at songkravte as is poor at weaving mana into his music. He aims to join the military as a songkravter, following in the footsteps of Selphine's mother, the late Queen Sela Rughzenhaide, but the lack of aptitude has him at a loss. For now, he looks up to Miishah, and spends his days with as part of his group of \"dropouts\" in the Rendel Forest."}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c123319"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/e2/e25468e4377c1de32d445138ccead5a66002e3f4d1b80c2ae7c78341c4c83f70.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/95/950062a59bfa5bb51c73845023dcf4fdcd4fee4f57ec95af20e56240b84f1e61.webp","width":218,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[]},{"characterId":"char_vndb_c24362","characterName":"セルフィーネ・ルゼンハイド","sourceIds":{"vndbCharacterId":"c24362"},"originalCharacterName":"セルフィーネ・ルゼンハイド","characterNameSource":null,"role":"side","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"source-authoritative","metadata":{"height":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"158"},"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"f"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"Princess Selphine Rughzenhaide is the sole heiress to the Kingdom of Rughzenhaide after her father, King Vhalar. Her energetic and youthful demeanor would appear as that of any ordinary growing girl's, but as heiress to the throne, Selphine had inherited a manakravte ability exclusive to the Royal Family of Rughzenhaide, the Path-Down manakravte. The Path-Down bestows the experiences, memories, and wisdom of the old kings and the present, unto the designated successor to the throne of Rughzenhaide. Currently, Selphine lacks the means to access this treasure trove of life lessons."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Selphine views her childhood friend and Royal Guardian, Ritona Reighnvhasta, as a role model worthy of her admiration, and the older sister she never had. If Selphine's obsessive curiosity ever got the best of her, Ritona would always there to guide her back with a stern, yet affectionate lecture."}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c24362"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/5a/5a281fc9786ebaf96e1489db66461e5a8b53c89136cac27635990583751e96ec.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/6a/6aec08596df98af59314582e046554365adda7f82c92d99139d1f7345e6123b2.webp","width":218,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[]},{"characterId":"char_vndb_c27784","characterName":"リトナ・レインヴァスタ","sourceIds":{"vndbCharacterId":"c27784"},"originalCharacterName":"リトナ・レインヴァスタ","characterNameSource":null,"role":"primary","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"source-authoritative","metadata":{"height":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"169"},"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"f"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"Selphine's royal guardian."}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c27784"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/89/8956912ae432d694a1383fece33afd831484b6d113c60633eff95e7ad21a46ed.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/94/949063fdae22dd1297f7238ca9fdab4bc315d4a0e4df0e7ce09beb9399f0eebf.webp","width":218,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[]},{"characterId":"char_vndb_c48672","characterName":"ミィシャ・ルグルス","sourceIds":{"vndbCharacterId":"c48672"},"originalCharacterName":"ミィシャ・ルグルス","characterNameSource":null,"role":"primary","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"source-authoritative","metadata":{"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"m"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"A cook at the Royal Kitchen of Rughzenhaide."}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c48672"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-as